  m_text: '<b>Basic light terms:</b>

    Emmission: Light that the surface itself
    generates

    Radiance: Outgoing light

    Irradiance: Incomming light

    BRDF:
    Bi-directional Radiance Distribution Function

    Directional light: Light that
    comes from a specific direction

    Diffuse: Non-directional

    Ambient light:
    Diffuse light that is around the world

'
