  m_text: "<b>Basic light effect terms:</b>\nSpecular: Bright highlight caused direct
    reflections\nGrazing angle: Low angle, when the view is almost parallel with
    the surface\nBaking: Storing the result of a complex calculation in a texture
    for example. \nReflection probe: Baked texture storing how the enviornment looks"
