    - target: {fileID: 759170773070658388, guid: bcefd6bd51ce47b438fb5d83f536cd3c,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: Bilinear filters blend the four closest pixels around the sampling point.
        This creates a much smoother transition. While it eliminates pixelation up
        close, viewing textures at a distance or at an angle causes them to look
        heavily blurred.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
